  <p id="c-songshu-052-yuantan-line:p001" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter"><persName id="c-songshu-052-yuantan-line:p001:m0000" ref="3tt_4ey_uti">湛</persName>弟<persName id="c-songshu-052-yuantan-line:p001:m0002" ref="xxh_xtr_3f9">豹</persName>字<persName id="c-songshu-052-yuantan-line:p001:m0004" ref="xxh_xtr_3f9">士蔚</persName></p>
  <p id="c-songshu-052-yuantan-line:p002" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter">子<persName id="c-songshu-052-yuantan-line:p002:m0001" ref="xxh_xtr_3f9_A">洵</persName></p>
  <p id="c-songshu-052-yuantan-line:p003" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter">事平，頃之卒，追贈征虜將軍，諡曰貞子。長子<persName id="c-songshu-052-yuantan-line:p003:m0021" ref="xxh_xtr_3f9_AA">顗</persName>，別有傳。少子<persName id="c-songshu-052-yuantan-line:p003:m0029" ref="xxh_xtr_3f9_AB">覬</persName>，好學善屬文，有清譽於世。官至司徒從事中郎、武陵內史，蚤卒。</p>
</text>
